  "body": "I'd like to autolink to the `autocomplete` attribute's `one-time-code` value from a Bikeshed document with `<{element/attribute/attribute value}>` syntax, but I've run into two problems:\r\n\r\n* The spec doesn't appear to export it.\r\n* re: the Bikeshed syntax, what should `element` be for [attributes common to form controls](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#attributes-common-to-form-controls)?",
